<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light">
<meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light">
<title>The Research Roundup – {{ month_label }}</title>
<style>
  body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #eef1f5; color: #1f2937; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; }
  table { border-collapse: collapse; }
  td { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; }  /* some clients (Gmail) drop <body> styles */
  a { color: #13315c; }
  .preheader { display: none; max-height: 0; overflow: hidden; mso-hide: all; font-size: 1px; line-height: 1px; color: #eef1f5; }
  .container { width: 600px; max-width: 600px; background: #ffffff; }
  .masthead { background: #0b2545; padding: 28px 32px 24px 32px; }
  .kicker { margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #9fb3c8; }
  .title { margin: 0; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size: 34px; line-height: 40px; font-weight: bold; color: #ffffff; }
  .tagline { margin: 8px 0 0 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; color: #d9e2ec; }
  .stats { background: #13315c; padding: 10px 32px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 18px; color: #d9e2ec; }
  .section { padding: 26px 32px 6px 32px; }
  .label { margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #13315c; }
  .note { margin: 0 0 14px 0; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size: 17px; line-height: 27px; color: #243b53; }
  .toc-row td { padding: 7px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #edf0f4; vertical-align: top; }
  .toc-num { width: 30px; font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; color: #9fb3c8; }
  .toc-headline { font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; color: #1f2937; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; }
  .toc-source { font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280; }
  .badge { display: inline-block; padding: 2px 7px; border-radius: 3px; font-size: 10px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 0.6px; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .card { padding: 26px 32px; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb; }
  .num { font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 28px; line-height: 28px; font-weight: bold; color: #d9e2ec; }
  .meta { margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 12px; line-height: 18px; color: #6b7280; }
  .headline { margin: 0 0 6px 0; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size: 22px; line-height: 28px; font-weight: bold; color: #0b2545; }
  .paper-title { margin: 0 0 14px 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 19px; color: #6b7280; }
  .summary { margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px; color: #1f2937; }
  .takeaways { margin: 0 0 16px 0; padding: 0 0 0 18px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; color: #1f2937; }
  .takeaways li { margin: 0 0 6px 0; }
  .why { padding: 12px 16px; background: #f5f7fa; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; color: #1f2937; }
  .why-label { font-weight: bold; color: #0b2545; }
  .focus { margin: 12px 0 0 0; font-size: 12px; line-height: 18px; color: #6b7280; }
  .button { display: inline-block; padding: 9px 16px; background: #0b2545; color: #ffffff !important; font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 3px; }
  .abstract-only { font-size: 11px; font-style: italic; color: #6b7280; }
  .footer { padding: 24px 32px 30px 32px; background: #f5f7fa; border-top: 3px solid #0b2545; font-size: 12px; line-height: 19px; color: #52606d; }
  .footer p { margin: 0 0 10px 0; }
  @media only screen and (max-width: 620px) {
    .container { width: 100% !important; }
    .masthead, .stats, .section, .card, .footer { padding-left: 18px !important; padding-right: 18px !important; }
    .title { font-size: 28px !important; line-height: 34px !important; }
    .headline { font-size: 20px !important; line-height: 26px !important; }
    .num-cell { display: none !important; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="preheader">{{ preheader }}</div>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#eef1f5" style="background: #eef1f5;">
<tr><td align="center" style="padding: 24px 0;">
<!--[if mso]><table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td><![endif]-->
<table role="presentation" class="container" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">

  <tr><td class="masthead" bgcolor="#0b2545">
    <p class="kicker">{{ month_label }} &nbsp;·&nbsp; Issue {{ issue_number }}</p>
    <h1 class="title">The Research Roundup</h1>
    <p class="tagline">The month's most useful new economics research for Global Markets: rates, FX, credit, macro and emerging markets.</p>
  </td></tr>
  <tr><td class="stats" bgcolor="#13315c">
    {{ papers_screened }} papers screened &nbsp;·&nbsp; {{ sources_monitored }} sources monitored &nbsp;·&nbsp; {{ papers|length }} selected
  </td></tr>

  <tr><td class="section">
    <p class="label">Editor's note</p>
    {% for para in note_paragraphs %}<p class="note">{{ para }}</p>{% endfor %}
  </td></tr>

  <tr><td class="section" style="padding-bottom: 22px;">
    <p class="label">In this issue</p>
    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
      {% for p in papers %}
      {% set tag = tag_colours[p.market_focus] %}
      <tr class="toc-row">
        <td class="toc-num">{{ loop.index }}</td>
        <td>
          <a class="toc-headline" href="#paper-{{ loop.index }}">{{ p.headline }}</a><br>
          <span class="badge" style="background: {{ tag.bg }}; color: {{ tag.fg }};">{{ p.market_focus }}</span>
          <span class="toc-source">&nbsp;{{ p.source_name }}</span>
        </td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </table>
  </td></tr>

  {% for p in papers %}
  {% set tag = tag_colours[p.market_focus] %}
  <tr><td class="card" id="paper-{{ loop.index }}">
    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr>
      <td class="num-cell" width="44" valign="top"><span class="num">{{ "%02d"|format(loop.index) }}</span></td>
      <td valign="top">
        <p class="meta">
          <span class="badge" style="background: {{ tag.bg }}; color: {{ tag.fg }};">{{ p.market_focus }}</span>
          &nbsp;{{ p.source_type }} &nbsp;·&nbsp; {{ p.source_name }} &nbsp;·&nbsp; {{ p.published_label }}
        </p>
        <h2 class="headline">{{ p.headline }}</h2>
        <p class="paper-title">{{ p.title }}{% if p.authors %}<br>{{ p.authors_label }}{% endif %}</p>
        <p class="summary">{{ p.summary }}</p>
        <p class="label">Key takeaways</p>
        <ul class="takeaways">
          {% for t in p.takeaways %}<li>{{ t }}</li>{% endfor %}
        </ul>
        <div class="why" style="border-left: 3px solid {{ tag.fg }};"><span class="why-label">Why it matters for markets.</span> {{ p.why_it_matters }}</div>
        <p class="focus"><strong>Market focus: {{ p.market_focus }}.</strong> {{ p.focus_rationale }}</p>
        <p style="margin: 16px 0 0 0;">
          <a class="button" href="{{ p.url }}">Read the paper &rarr;</a>
          {% if p.paywalled %}&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="abstract-only">Summary based on abstract</span>{% endif %}
        </p>
      </td>
    </tr></table>
  </td></tr>
  {% endfor %}

  <tr><td class="footer">
    <p><strong>How this issue was made.</strong> Each week we collect new papers from {{ sources_monitored }} sources: the top five economics journals, G10 and European central banks, the twelve regional Federal Reserve Banks, NBER, Brookings, the IMF and the BIS. A language model screens every paper for relevance and market focus. Each month an AI editor reviews the strongest {{ pool_size }} candidates, chooses a balanced selection and writes the summaries. Summaries are based on titles and abstracts only; for paywalled journals and NBER we never use the full text. Check the original paper before citing it.</p>
    <p>
      <span class="badge" style="background: {{ tag_colours.EM.bg }}; color: {{ tag_colours.EM.fg }};">EM</span> emerging and developing economies &nbsp;
      <span class="badge" style="background: {{ tag_colours.DM.bg }}; color: {{ tag_colours.DM.fg }};">DM</span> advanced economies &nbsp;
      <span class="badge" style="background: {{ tag_colours.Transversal.bg }}; color: {{ tag_colours.Transversal.fg }};">Transversal</span> global, cross-country or methodological
    </p>
    {% if site_url %}<p><a href="{{ site_url }}/issues/{{ month }}/">View this issue online</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <a href="{{ site_url }}/papers/">Explore every screened paper</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <a href="{{ site_url }}/sources/">Sources and coverage</a></p>{% endif %}
  </td></tr>

</table>
<!--[if mso]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->
</td></tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
